# Syncthing ignore rules for the Obsidian sync folder.
#
# WHY THIS EXISTS
# Obsidian writes per-device UI/runtime state (open panes, cursor positions,
# recent-files, the resolved plugin bundle) into `.obsidian/` and rewrites it
# constantly and independently on every machine. Syncing those files makes
# Syncthing race against itself and spew `*.sync-conflict-*` files forever.
# Ignoring the device-local state stops the conflicts at the source while still
# syncing your actual notes and the *shared* plugin configuration.
#
# HOW SYNCTHING USES THIS FILE
# Syncthing reads `.stignore` from the synced folder root. With the leading
# `(?d)` flag, ignored files are ALSO deletable so a leftover conflict file on
# one device does not get re-propagated. This file itself can be synced via the
# `#include` mechanism, but the simplest robust setup is to install it on every
# device (see ops/syncthing-obsidian-stignore.sh). Order matters: the first
# matching pattern wins, so keep `!` un-ignore rules ABOVE the broad ignores.
#
# Patterns are relative to the folder root. `**` matches across directories.

# --- Always drop any conflict files Syncthing already produced -------------
(?d)**.sync-conflict-*

# --- Keep genuinely shared, portable plugin config -------------------------
# These are safe to sync: they are the same intent across devices.
!**/.obsidian/app.json
!**/.obsidian/appearance.json
!**/.obsidian/hotkeys.json
!**/.obsidian/community-plugins.json
!**/.obsidian/themes/**
!**/.obsidian/snippets/**

# --- Ignore per-device Obsidian state (the conflict generators) ------------
(?d)**/.obsidian/workspace.json
(?d)**/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
(?d)**/.obsidian/core-plugins.json
(?d)**/.obsidian/core-plugins-migration.json
(?d)**/.obsidian/graph.json
# Per-device plugin runtime/state (cursor positions, recent files, caches) and
# the compiled plugin bundles, which Obsidian re-fetches per device anyway.
(?d)**/.obsidian/plugins/**/data.json
(?d)**/.obsidian/plugins/**/cursor-positions.json
(?d)**/.obsidian/plugins/**/main.js
(?d)**/.obsidian/plugins/**/styles.css
(?d)**/.obsidian/plugins/**/manifest.json

# --- Common cross-tool noise ------------------------------------------------
(?d)**/.DS_Store
(?d)**/Thumbs.db
